sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant F as Frontend (Web/Mobile)
  participant B as Backend (Express)
  participant V as Vectorstore (FAISS)
  participant O as Azure OpenAI

  U->>F: Ask policy question
  F->>B: POST /api/chat {query}
  B->>V: MMR search (k=12, fetch_k=36)
  V-->>B: Top-k chunks + scores
  B->>O: Prompt(query + context)
  O-->>B: Answer + citations
  B-->>F: { answer, sources }
  F-->>U: Render response + sources
